---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Panel from '../components/Panel.astro';
import { site, links, stats } from '../site.config';
import { experience } from '../resume';
import { url } from '../utils';
---

<Base title="About" description={`About ${site.name}: who I am, what I do, and how to get in touch.`}>
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>

  <div class="split">
    <div class="main">
      <!-- First draft written from the résumé. Rewrite it in your own voice. -->
      <p>
        Hi, I’m Skyy. I’m based in Columbus, Ohio, and I’ve taken a non-traditional path: the Army, warehouses
        and e-commerce, policy research, teaching people to fly a 737 simulator, and now training AI models.
      </p>
      <p>
        The common thread is figuring out how complicated things work and explaining them clearly, whether
        that’s a flight procedure, a policy brief, or why a language model got an answer wrong. I like solving
        messy problems, paying attention to details, and bringing teams together around them.
      </p>
      <p>
        I just finished my A.A. in International Studies, I’m working toward my private pilot certificate, and
        I’m always building something. This site is where I keep track of all of it.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="side">
      <Panel title="Stats" meta="Player 1" rows={stats} />
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="label">Path so far</h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    {experience.map((job) => (
      <li>
        <div>{job.role} · <span class="muted">{job.org}</span></div>
        <span class="meta label">{job.dates}</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
  <a class="more" href={url('/resume')}>Full résumé →</a>

  <h2 class="label">Get in touch</h2>
  <p>
    The best way to reach me is{' '}
    {links.map((l, i) => (
      <>{i > 0 && (i === links.length - 1 ? ' or ' : ', ')}<a href={l.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{l.label}</a></>
    ))}.
  </p>
</Base>
